_text","block_id":"7fx2T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0fae6bf0-3c95-4df9-a8be-639e5c0e24ab","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"自分で直しましたが","ts":"1628867505.341600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pOpR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6d2c7d61-1060-4936-9784-da253054ce7f","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"ES6 class と function で作られるインスタンスが別物になるので prototype の扱いが変わる。テストで prototype チェックしてメソッドを置き換える方法を別の実装しないと動かない。ということ","ts":"1628867426.341200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GRHyD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7b68ff6-ca19-427a-87ca-f936f9574cfb","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"jasmine がどういう形式のクラスを期待しているのか次第な気がします。クラスの作り方、別に1つじゃないので","ts":"1628867415.340900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tkrCf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db815ac5-6473-49d8-8431-56f2296c9362","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"jasmine の問題?","ts":"1628867351.339500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sKz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"490beff1-a681-4e25-9600-44c73bf2d6a4","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"えーと、今コードを掘り出した。\n`jasmine.spyOnAllFunctions` が ES6 class で作られたインスタンスに適用できないんですよね。","ts":"1628867298.339300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mew"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d868fb2b-b53f-41cc-a47b-1b89d0318ea7","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"例を挙げるならVim8で使えるメソッド記法","ts":"1628867151.337700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"50q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc4517c5-6681-4a9d-9b89-c9cd924e0a46","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"既存の文法でも表現できるけど、より簡単に書けるものを糖衣構文というので合っていると思います。","ts":"1628867131.337400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PBg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9cc56966-d975-4db2-b045-7cb62a72bb1b","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"Proxy みたいな、今までなら不可能だったような機能(ポリフィル不可能な機能)以外は、変換できちゃってるので構文糖衣という力技解釈","ts":"1628867041.336800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j6rhs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55d432f0-c875-4416-9e3d-c3ab37670a2e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Symbol でも列挙しちゃえば見れちゃうからかな","ts":"1628866985.335000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A3y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9ae8551-a64a-4fe2-8efb-0080d6297783","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Symbol 使うんだと思ってたので意外だった","ts":"1628866938.333800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+cNKG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20e1e644-a7f6-4660-a53a-f4502a39e864","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"なんか最近はそんなんだった気がします。この前ちらっと見た気がする \u0026gt;WeakRef","ts":"1628866925.333200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8=Ce"}]},{"client_msg_id":"64214cf4-b59d-4e13-b58e-ffe49d1a589f","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"private class field なんかは WeakRef を使うコードにダウンパイルされたような気がする","ts":"1628866897.332400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9Vk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a17479d2-4675-4701-8c47-1f9c3bc3432d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"class が既存文法の糖衣構文なので既存構文に書き換えることはできるが、既存構文で書いた黒魔術クラスを class 記法で書けるとは言っていない","ts":"1628866888.332000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lEfS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"609967a8-583b-4f51-94b6-2a70d1c119b9","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"テストが target によって動かなくなるんですよね。","ts":"1628866851.330400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"yabai","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U06ECBRTJ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uut"}]},{"client_msg_id":"614487cb-a047-4567-a30a-3278db818928","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"そうか。private クラスフィールドが最近はあるのか。\nこれも babel が変換できてる以上は構文糖衣といっていいと思いますが。","ts":"1628866844.330200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RkX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b4601029-d8c4-443a-97a8-d2460d444a38","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"と言うか TS で target をアレすると class 使わない JS が吐かれなかったっけ?","ts":"1628866826.329400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"inhpk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7bb9130e-23fb-4457-91e5-601a363a6a86","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"ちょっと魔術的なことしてたら class だと通らなくて困った。","ts":"1628866823.329200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GIB"}]}]
